abstract: >-
  Python implementation of KTide (Q=0 recursive least squares on stored
  coastal archives) recorded in Kim and Byun (J. Atmos. Oceanic Technol.,
  in prep.). Not MATLAB KTide, T_TIDE, UTide, TIRA, NEMO diaharm, or
  Heemink/Smith sequential writings.
